@startuml test_handshake_math_correctness
participant "Edge Gateway" as EG
participant "Cloud Service" as CS

note over EG, CS: Session Negotiation
EG -> EG: Generate DH Key Pair
CS -> CS: Generate DH Key Pair

EG -> CS: Transmit Gateway Public Key
CS -> EG: Transmit Cloud Public Key

EG -> EG: Compute Shared Secret & Derive AES Key
CS -> CS: Compute Shared Secret & Derive AES Key

note over EG, CS: Assertion: EG.SharedSecret == CS.SharedSecret\nAssertion: EG.AESKey == CS.AESKey
@enduml
